(The old man tightened the brass latch before looking up. His eyes) Tj T*
(were the pale grey of sea glass.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
('A lighthouse warns ships away from the reef three miles out,' he) Tj T*
(replied, rising slowly to his feet. 'It speaks to captains on high) Tj T*
(bridges with radar and charts. Down here, beneath the bluff, the) Tj T*
(tall beam passes fifty feet above the water.') Tj T*
() Tj T*
(He pointed into the dark lee of the harbour wall, where the stone) Tj T*
(steps disappeared beneath black swells. 'Small rowboats coming home) Tj T*
(late from the mussel beds cannot see the headland through low mist.) Tj T*
(They look for something at eye level - something steady that says:) Tj T*
(the landing stairs are three oar-strokes to your left.') Tj T*
